  },
  "behavior_in_tests": {
    "outcome": "pass",
    "explanation": "The tests in test.patch cover exactly what instruction.md promises: nearest-spoke pointer attribution across multiple series counts/angle ranges, wrap-around hover behavior, label-vs-plotted-series agreement, and regression coverage for default orientation and pie charts (p2p). No described behavior is left untested."
  },
  "informative_test_structure": {
    "outcome": "pass",
    "explanation": "test.patch is organized into clearly named describe/it blocks ('full-circle polar chart pointer attribution', 'full-circle polar chart series placement', 'polar tooltip regressions') with helper functions (pointAt, directionOf, nearestSpoke, readSpokes) that are documented with short comments explaining intent, and test.sh is divided into clearly labeled numbered steps (restore, apply patch, install deps, run tests, compute reward)."
